  XX    XX    XX     XX    XX    XX                    XX    XX    XX    XX    XX    XX
  XX    @undo S-del  C-ins S-ins @agan                 @agan S-ins C-ins S-del @undo XX
  XX    met   alt    ctl   sft   XX                    XX    sft   ctl   alt   met   XX
  XX    @undo S-del  C-ins S-ins @agan                 @agan S-ins C-ins S-del @undo XX
        XX    XX     XX    XX                                XX    XX    XX    XX

                             XX    XX       XX    XX
                        mmid mlft  XX       XX    mlft  mmid                            
                                   mrgt     mrgt
)

(deflayer template-XX
